    "Every step for this chapter — writing, repairs, revisions, its summary and checks — uses a model that allows dark content. The chapter is then walled off: not searched, quoted or read by the chat. The next chapter sees only a short summary and what changed (where people are, injuries, who learned what), which you check and edit before moving on.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every step for this chapter — writing, repairs, revisions, its summary and checks — uses a model that allows dark content. The chapter is then walled off: not searched, quoted or read by the chat. The next chapter sees only a short summary and what changed (where people are, injuries, who learned what), which you check and edit before moving on."
          }
        }
      }
    },
